        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan had seen rank one grass puppet Gu at Qing Mao Mountain, used as a target for practicing moon blades. At rank one it is no threat; at rank two it can kill an ordinary hunter. Tie Ruo Nan’s worm is rank three. The grassman puppet she creates is short and thin, with leaves tightly woven, a bamboo blade in one hand and a rattan shell shield in the other: a rattan shell grass soldier with strength to kill a rank one Gu Master. Numbers make them troublesome, and with a rank four Gu Master’s strength a dozen can combine into a rank four grass sword elite soldier.",
        "chapters": [
          360
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
