  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Tie Ruo Nan half-kneels with both hands pressed to the ground while plants grow wild beside her. Dozens of huge grass strands intertwine in emerald-green light into a grassman puppet: grass puppet Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          360
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_ruo_nan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Chapter 428 names enslavement path, rank three grass puppet Gu. Fang Yuan obtained one in three kings blessed land from someone he killed. Earlier, when he fought one against seven at San Cha Mountain, Tie Ruo Nan had used such a Gu. The Gu is rather common in Southern Border. At rank three it can create an army of rattan shell grass soldiers; at rank four it can create grass sword elite soldiers with stronger battle strength. In Northern Plains the Gu is restricted and the rattan shell grass soldiers it creates are weak.",
        "chapters": [
          428
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-worm-and-northern-plains",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_three_kings_blessed_land",
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "reg_southern_border",
          "reg_northern_plains"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Bei tribe leader injects primeval essence into grass underfoot and forms rank four grass puppet Gu grass sword elite soldiers that hold green leaf long swords.",
        "chapters": [
          479
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bei-tribe-grass-sword-elites",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_bei_tribe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ying Wu Xie identifies a green grass puppet as a grass puppet avatar formed from rank six grass puppet Gu with rank six battle strength. When Feng Chan Zi ascended to immortal, his grandfather Old Man Bei Feng gave him that grass puppet Immortal Gu as a gift.",
        "chapters": [
          1052
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "grass-puppet-avatar",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ying_wu_xie",
          "char_feng_chan_zi",
          "char_old_man_bei_feng",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
